# ─── Lean repo: large assets NOT needed by the Kaggle pipeline ────────────────
# All kept on local disk (only untracked from git); either regenerable,
# reference-only, or personal deliverables that do not belong in the Kaggle
# data source. This section is last so it overrides earlier re-include rules.
docs/
route_planning/
data/processed/combined_dataset.csv
# Redundant training checkpoints — Kaggle rebuilds these; keep only best_full model.
results/models/checkpoints/checkpoint_epoch_*.pt
results/models/checkpoints_lstm_only/
results/models/checkpoints_transformer_only/
results/models/checkpoints_debug*/
